        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-7,\\ 5,\\ -6$",
          "worked": "By the zero-product property,\n$$x+7=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-5=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x+6=0.$$\nThus $x=-7,\\ 5,\\ -6$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-q1-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(x-3)^2(x+1)=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=3,\\ -1$",
          "worked": "$x-3=0$ or $x+1=0$.\nThus $x=3$ or $x=-1$. The repeated factor gives the same solution $x=3$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-q1-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$5(x-2)(x-4)(x-6)(x-8)=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=2,\\ 4,\\ 6,\\ 8$",
          "worked": "The constant factor $5$ is nonzero, so\n$$x-2=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-4=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-6=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-8=0.$$\nThus $x=2,\\ 4,\\ 6,\\ 8$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 22
      },
      {
        "id": "p23-q1-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$4x(x-7)^2(x+8)^2=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=0,\\ 7,\\ -8$",
          "worked": "$x=0$ or $x-7=0$ or $x+8=0$.\nThus $x=0,\\ 7,\\ -8$. Repeated factors do not introduce additional distinct solutions.",
